  "report_summary": "Left breast core biopsy performed for asymmetrically dense left breast on imaging (M3, U3) shows extranodal marginal zone B-cell lymphoma, presumed to be of MALT type, with an immunophenotype of CD20+, CD79a+, BCL2+, CD5-, CD10-, cyclin D1-, patchy CD23, and a subset of larger cells expressing IRF4/MUM1, BCL6, CD30 and CD138. Kappa/lambda immunohistochemistry was uninformative. Ki-67 proliferative fraction generally low (~20%). No evidence of high-grade transformation at this site."
